{"id": "y0411", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you want to watch a movie without leaving your home, the best option would be C, television. You can stream movies directly on TV platforms or use apps like Netflix and Hulu that are accessible through most TVs these days. While E, show, might also work if referring to an online streaming service, tele vision is generally the more direct answer since it encompasses all those options in one term.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
