{"id": "y0475", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you don't live in a detached dwelling, the most practical place to have a stove would likely be your apartment. Most apartment s have designated kitchen areas where stoves are installed and safe to use. While options like a tent or car might work for temporary cooking, they lack the proper setup needed for regular use. So an apartment is the best choice here.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
